$ heat
load of a missing file: error /= 0 is T
missing section:     error 3, cells kept: -1
not an integer:      error 2, cells kept: -1
out of range (I1P):  error 2, small kept: -1
array too small:     error 2, origin kept: -1.0 -1.0
unsupported type:    error 2
error is err_option_vals
save without a file name: iostat 7, "file_ini%save: no file name"
save into a missing directory: iostat /= 0 is T
